      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-06T21:34:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yep, that sounds about right. EC-3PO calculates a CRC of the command and if it fails, then the command is rejected. But note that this is for enhanced consoles only and I don\u0027t think any board defines this currently.",
      "parentUuid": "01dd4679_0289566e",
      "revId": "d49fcfc6ab2b1b85c6c5689c48baf2949046b527",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
